  "AGRO ALLIANCE platformasiga kirish orqali siz ushbu foydalanish shartlariga rozilik bildirasiz. Agar shartlarga rozi bo'lmasangiz, platformadan foydalanmangiz.": "By accessing the AGRO ALLIANCE platform you agree to these terms of use. If you do not agree with the terms, please do not use the platform.",
  "Platformadan foydalanish uchun hisob yaratishingiz kerak. Hisob ma'lumotlaringiz xavfsiz saqlanadi va faqat sizning ruxsatingiz bilan boshqalar bilan baham ko'riladi. Hisobingiz xavfsizligini ta'minlash sizning zimmangizda.": "To use the platform you need to create an account. Your account data is stored securely and shared with others only with your permission. Keeping your account secure is your responsibility.",
  "Platformaga joylashtirilgan kontent mualliflik huquqi bilan himoyalangan. Boshqa foydalanuvchilarning kontentini ruxsatsiz ko'chirish yoki tarqatish taqiqlanadi. Agro soha bo'yicha foydali va haqiqiy kontent yaratishni tavsiya qilamiz.": "Content published on the platform is protected by copyright. Copying or distributing other users' content without permission is prohibited. We encourage you to create useful and truthful content about agriculture.",
  "Shaxsiy ma'lumotlaringiz faqat platforma xizmatlarini ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Batafsil ma'lumot uchun": "Your personal data is used only to provide the platform's services. For details please read the",
  "AGRO ALLIANCE platformasi foydalanuvchilar tomonidan yaratilgan kontent uchun javobgar emas. Foydalanuvchilar o'z kontentlari uchun shaxsiy javobgar.": "The AGRO ALLIANCE platform is not responsible for content created by users. Users are personally responsible for their own content.",
  "Savollaringiz bo'lsa,": "If you have questions, contact us via",
  "ni o'qing.": ".",
  "orqali biz bilan bog'laning.": ".",
  "Biz faqat xizmatlarimizni ko'rsatish uchun zarur bo'lgan ma'lumotlarni yig'amiz: ism, email manzili, telefon raqami va profil ma'lumotlari.": "We collect only the data necessary to provide our services: name, email address, phone number and profile information.",
  "Shaxsiy ma'lumotlaringiz quyidagi maqsadlarda ishlatiladi:": "Your personal data is used for the following purposes:",
  "Shaxsiy ma'lumotlaringiz xavfsiz serverlarda saqlanadi va ruxsatsiz kirishdan himoyalangan. Biz SSL shifrlash va boshqa xavfsizlik texnologiyalaridan foydalanamiz.": "Your personal data is stored on secure servers and protected from unauthorised access. We use SSL encryption and other security technologies.",
  "Biz shaxsiy ma'lumotlaringizni uchinchi tomonlarga sotmaymiz yoki ijaraga bermaymiz. Faqat qonuniy talablar bo'yicha va sizning ruxsatingiz bilan bo'lishish mumkin.": "We do not sell or rent your personal data to third parties. Sharing is possible only under legal requirements and with your permission.",
